---
import Layout from 'layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About {{site_name}}" description="{{site_description}}">
  <section class="shell prose-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">About this scaffold</p>
    <h1>Extracted from existing Astro production patterns</h1>
    <p>
      This template keeps the useful patterns from the reference sites:
      layout component boundaries, design tokens, simple nav/footer, and
      section-driven page composition.
    </p>
    <p>
      It intentionally removes event data, branding, private assets, and
      organization-specific copy.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
